@startuml
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus" {
  usecase "View availability" as UC_View
  usecase "Book room" as UC_Book
  usecase "Cancel booking" as UC_Cancel
  usecase "Block / unblock room" as UC_Block
  usecase "Review usage" as UC_Review
}

Student --> UC_View
Student --> UC_Book
Student --> UC_Cancel
Administrator --> UC_Block
Administrator --> UC_Review

note right of UC_Book
R1: start is in the future; duration > 0 and <= 2 hours.
R2: active bookings for the same room cannot overlap.
R3: a blocked room cannot accept a new booking.
R4: a successful booking produces a confirmation.
Assumptions:
A1: touching bookings are allowed (12:00 end and 12:00 start do not overlap).
A2: blocking a booked room keeps existing bookings; it prevents new ones.
end note

@enduml
